[I] GNOME library for deferred execution

[T] Dex provides Future-based programming for GLib-based applications. It both
[T] integrates with and brings new features for application and library authors
[T] who want to structure concurrent code in an easy to manage way.

[U] https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libdex

